  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "933957aeaba687e9dea10b28d56cc06f5625c8e5748e956711053a32334e97d2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "大家没事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "没、没事，整栋楼都不见了......那到底是什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "你呢？你刚才直接穿过了法术的正中心吧，总是那么乱来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "噗嗤，我这才发现，怎么把长头发剪短了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "喂，你刚刚笑出来了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "头上都沾满了沙子，就算是短发也不能不珍惜啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "我没事的啦，谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "......谢谢？我们已经这么生疏了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "这只说明我讲文明懂礼貌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "呵呵，说的也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "如果你不总是在工作时间睡觉，在教堂外搞摇滚乐演出，出了岔子再让公证所的人追你三条街的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "被你失手炸掉的母校在你离开拉特兰的那一天可是拉了横幅的哦？“欢送能天使前往龙门”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "什么？这是老友聚会互揭伤疤之类的必备项目吗？好嘞，该我了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "请便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "......不好，这么一想，我好像都不太清楚你的黑料！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "好孩子不该知道那么多喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "你是我老姐吗！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "欸，差不多吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "（这两个人好像关系很好呢，因为都是拉特兰人吗？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "（而且能天使竟然也会被抢走话茬......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "那个......莫斯提马。我还是有一点小问题要问啦，小小的问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "为什么这个时候回来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "唔，嗯，原因是有不少啦，怎么说呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "第一，是工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "第二，龙门安魂节总是会搞促销嘛，回龙门凑个热闹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "......那么多年的安魂夜你都不知所踪，偏偏在今年回来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "其实你想问的不是这个吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "诶......你察觉到了就直接告诉我嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "呵呵，难得看到你纠结的样子，让人很怀念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "而且，不管怎么说，也不能当着来参观学习的人面说那些弯弯绕绕的话题呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "啊......没事，我会在后面跟着的，你们请便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "这可不行，还不排除被追踪的可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "啊！用拜松当借口也太狡猾了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "先和德克萨斯他们汇合吧，那么多吓人的黑手党还在虎视眈眈呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "我不在的时候，你们总是这么惹麻烦吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "也算不上经常？每周有个四五六七八天的样子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "......嗯，的确不太经常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "那你呢？去了哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "你知道我刚见到老板的时候，老板说你已经离开龙门了，那种长跑到终点线前摔了一跤的感觉吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "很多地方，多到数不清。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "来到一座无人问津的村子，接下一封信，再前往群山的另一面，追着移动城市跑，就这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "听着真孤独呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "但写成游记的话说不定能大卖？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "莫斯提马小姐，去过所有国家吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "大部分吧，羡慕吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "......有一点，一般的信使是不会有这样的机会的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "会有机会的。不过你可别指望企鹅物流哦，我们是不能用常理来判断的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "关于这点，我已经心知肚明了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "在漫漫大漠中坐着卡车，盯着落日穿过黄沙，听着是很浪漫，但当浪漫持续上百个小时的时候，也就消磨殆尽了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "黄沙落日我是没怎么见到过啦，但你不觉得今天沙尘很大吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "这几年龙门的空气质量下降了不少喔，该增加几台空气净化器了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "空气质量吗......也许吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "能天使，拜松，虽然很抱歉，但你们得先——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松&能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "又来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "哎呀，我对自己离开的时机拿捏的还是比较好的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "......你认真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "但是对你而言只是几个小时，对我而言可是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "算了，莫斯提马！回头请我吃饭！必须！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "——知道啦知道啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "......真是的，今晚还真热闹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "我们真的就抛下莫斯提马小姐一个人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "谁抛下谁？反正就算不听她的，她也会在哪个时间点突然消失的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "......你在生气？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "——啊啊！先去找德克萨斯！剩下的之后再说！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "能天使那家伙，这种时候，偏偏不在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "呃，我们这是惹上麻烦了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "他们把我们包围了。突然出现的敌人，一开始就埋伏在贫民窟里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "这些家伙，是和那些黑手党一伙的？可看着不像啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "不，有几个熟悉的面孔，都是龙门本地人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门路人？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门路人？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "听老大的，给他们点教训。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "嗯，嗯？嗯......我们不是在找德克萨斯吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "发生了什么，我们才会被这些突然冒出来的家伙包围的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门路人？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......是你们闯进来的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "看吧！还不是因为能天使你瞎指路！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门路人？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "很抱歉，你们不能轻易离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "既然你也是丰蹄，也拿着面盾——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "呃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "那可颂和我怎么办，咱们就怎么办！你开路，我殿后，但这次估计没奖金了，上啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
